@samcoe I don't think this is related to `skipAuthCheck` but that the [command itself asserts](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/d35ef85e318c8cf1da7a096d8b4cd9c5b54a4f1f/pkg/cmd/auth/setupgit/setupgit.go#L86) this? 

I agree that if you provide the `hostname` flag that this check doesn't need to be enforced. 

I think if you were to run it with no logged in hosts it should either continue to do what it does, or default to github.com (which is essentially the only known host). In the absence of a good reason to default it, I'd say leave it as it is.
